WEBVTT

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:11.050
This is...

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:31.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:38.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:44.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:50.830
I was searching for your smile

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:58.200
With our memories fading

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:05.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:12.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:19.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:43.940
Pulse of a New Darkness

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:52.910
The ruins discovered in the Caribbean Sea are the oldest in the world.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:59.400
They believe it's a legendary prehistoric civilization that sank into the seas.

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.420
Be careful!  Watch where you're going!

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:05.770
You too!

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:06.960
You're...

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.880
- Insector Haga!
- Dinosaur Ryuzaki!

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:16.070
Battle City is over.  What are you doing here?

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:19.080
I-I can do whatever I want.

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.510
What are YOU doing here?

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.950
N-Nothing special.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.770
Don't follow me!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.650
You too!

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.000
The God Cards are mine!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.260
I'll get them no matter what I have to do!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.200
He won't get them before me!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:42.600
The God Cards are mine, even if I have to give up all my money and rare cards!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.820
Outta the way!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.580
Ouch...

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.310
Why are you standing here?

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.680
That's dangerous!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.130
You're Dinosaur Ryuzaki and Insector Haga.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.940
What?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.610
What do you want with us?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:19.040
I'm taking your souls!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.220
What do you mean?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.910
Don't waste your breath!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:24.990
Duel!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.320
What's up, Anzu?

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.470
What are you doing here?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.700
Just thinking.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:51.900
About Yugi?

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.340
Yeah.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.680
My other self, where are we going?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.680
Partner, did you bring the God Cards?

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.620
Yeah.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:08.550
Are you...

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:11.220
Yeah.  Let's go to the museum.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.430
But why so sudden?  We haven't told our friends.

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:19.300
That's fine.  It'll be hard if they see me off.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:23.160
Partner, just you is fine.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.870
My other self...

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:37.680
Yugi!

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.130
We made it in time!

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.120
Everyone...

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:47.960
We were suspicious that you left so quickly, so we ran after you.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.460
Leaving without telling us?  Not cool, Yugi.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:55.200
The other Yugi is leaving on a journey, right?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.640
If we didn't see him off, we'd regret it for the rest of our lives.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.860
Yugi, no matter how far apart...

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.730
...our hearts are always together.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.570
Yeah.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.580
Thanks, everyone.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:24.580
(chanting)

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.870
So this is the stone tablet.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:34.300
He does look like Yugi.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.330
The time has finally come.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.620
By presenting these three God Cards to the tablet...

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:44.900
...a new path to my lost memories will open.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.250
What will happen?

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.690
The answer lies here!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.140
My other self...

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.150
The tablet!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.530
What's happening?

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:10.470
(chanting)

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.570
Yugi!

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:18.480
What's wrong?

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.820
W-What?

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:25.760
Some other power is interfering with me!

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.150
What do you mean?

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:29.350
The door to your memories won't open?

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:31.760
What happened to this tablet?

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.100
What in the world?

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.270
Duel Monsters!

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.900
Is someone using his Duel Disk to play a trick?

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.210
There are too many for that.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:56.820
Jonouchi, Kaiba Corporation's central computer handles all monster data, right?

00:07:56.820 --> 00:08:01.710
So we might learn something if we go to Kaiba Corporation.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.160
Yeah.  Let's go.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:12.870
This is Kaiba Corporation.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.480
We're checking right now.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:18.540
- There's nothing wrong with our computers.  
 - So you say, but...

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.950
Monsters are all over the city!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.310
Isn't that...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.080
Ryuzaki and Haga.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.750
What are you doing here?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.690
The omen has begun.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:37.690
The world will soon end.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.030
Omen?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.520
The world will end?  What do you mean?

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.300
You guys are creepy.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:48.560
We don't have time for this.  Let's go!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.420
Yeah.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:53.050
Give us a statement!

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.300
Rumors say the Solid Vision System is malfunctioning!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.210
The system is working properly.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:01.080
We're not responsible for this incident.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.760
Then how do you explain this phenomenon?

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:05.870
Give us a statement from Kaiba!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.620
Kaiba is away on business in America.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.940
We have work to do.  Please leave.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.870
We'll hold a press conference later.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:17.630
Please leave for now!

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:20.640
The people won't accept this!

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.400
When's the press conference?

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.760
I bet Kaiba is actually here!

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.440
What a commotion.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.510
I wonder if Kaiba is okay.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.700
Next news topic:

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:40.310
Duel Monsters' Solid Vision images are appearing worldwide.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:45.720
People are panicking, blocking traffic and causing damage.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.720
It's happening worldwide?

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:50.700
Not just Domino City.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:57.190
We present Kaiba Corporation president's press conference, live from America.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.840
Kaiba.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:03.500
My company's system has nothing to do with this incident.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.800
When the incident started, we shut down the system for maintenance.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:11.500
But the monsters kept appearing.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:17.010
That means a different system is creating those monsters.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.520
What's going on?

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:21.660
If it's not Kaiba's system...

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:26.080
Does it have anything to do with what happened to the tablet?

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.900
Yeah.  I was thinking the same thing.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:34.680
A strong, unknown power sealed the tablet and the door to my memories.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:37.580
And the monsters appeared right after.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:42.250
What Haga and Ryuzaki said also trouble me.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.220
The omen has begun.

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:49.690
The world will soon end.

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:53.800
They were acting weird.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:56.480
An omen for the end of the world...

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:02.800
Grandpa!

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.120
Grandpa, hang on!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.550
You okay, Grandpa?

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.670
Yugi, I'm sorry.

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:10.180
What happened, Grandpa?

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.110
The God Cards...

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.530
No way!

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.660
They were stolen?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:16.540
I'm sorry.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:17.600
Damn!

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:19.900
You won't get away!

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:26.080
Obelisk the Tormentor?

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:45.360
That's...

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.980
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:52.040
Not just Obelisk!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.590
Ra and Slifer too!

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:59.590
Only someone related to the Millennium Items can summon the three Gods.

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:00.770
Who can it be?

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:02.960
What?

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:04.360
Damn!

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.400
Who are you?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.930
When the forbidden door opens...

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:12.640
...Orichalcos's light will judge the tainted world.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.840
We are Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.260
Three Musketeers?

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:19.010
Did you steal the God Cards?

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:19.950
Yes!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.450
We have the cards, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.890
They know about my other self!

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.340
We're offering you a challenge.

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:37.330
If you want your cards back, come to that building under construction.

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:38.720
We'll be waiting!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:46.000
Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.820
Where are you?  Show yourselves!

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:04.130
Welcome.  I've been waiting, Yugi Muto.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.260
Or should I call you the Nameless Pharaoh?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:10.430
Hey!  Are you with those guys?

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.600
Yes!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.820
My name is Gurimo.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:20.280
I serve Rafael, one of Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:23.630
Accept my duel!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:29.050
Fine.  But I'll tell you something first.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:33.490
Only the chosen ones can use the God Cards.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:37.920
If someone else uses them, you'll anger the Gods.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:42.670
Then see for yourself whether I can use them or not.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.020
Interesting.  I accept this duel!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:52.370
Let's see what you got, Yugi Muto!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.700
Duel!

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:58.080
I go first!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:58.810
I draw!

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:04.250
I summon Beta The Magnet Warrior in defense position!

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:10.260
I set one card!

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:15.610
I can't attack on the first turn.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:17.360
I end my turn.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:22.520
Nameless Pharaoh, I'll test your strength.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.010
My turn.  I draw.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.800
The opponent has the God Cards.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:34.660
If he can use them, Yugi wll be...

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:39.020
Don't worry!  Yugi is the King of Duelists.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.020
He won't lose that easily.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.800
I summon Marauding Captain.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.440
Marauding Captain's effect activates!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:53.470
I can summon a Level 4 or below monster from my hand.

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:55.740
I summon Shadow Tamer!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.080
He summoned two monsters in one turn.

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:07.010
Yugi, I'll show you our true power.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:13.690
Behold!  The spell card created from the darkness!

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:17.250
Its mysterious power is mine.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:21.270
Surround me and my enemy in a sacred seal!

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:25.020
I activate The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:36.100
What?

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.100
Everyone!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.350
The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:59.600
No one else can enter.  We can only continue dueling.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:07.060
Until the duel is over, no one can enter or leave.

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:12.780
Only the winner of the duel can leave.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:18.220
The Seal will seal away the loser's soul!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:22.360
What?  He can play Shadow Games?

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.600
In that case...

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.240
What?

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.440
That won't work!

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:37.570
Millennium Items are powerless inside the Seal.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:44.220
The Seal of Orichalcos has different powers than a Millennium Item?

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:50.120
The Seal of Orichalcos's true power is only beginning.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:55.960
It changes my monsters into Dark monsters, and they gain 500 attack points.

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.260
What?

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.560
Go, Marauding Captain!

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.360
Attack Beta The Magnet Warrior!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.870
I activate my trap card!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.740
Soul Rope!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:22.480
When my monster is destroyed, I pay 1000 life points to summon a Level 4 monster from my deck.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:29.530
Gamma The Magnet Warrior in defense position!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:35.080
So you didn't let all your monsters be destroyed.

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.400
I set a card.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:40.070
I end my turn.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.220
Ouch...

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:48.010
His personality changed when he activated that Seal.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:51.830
Maybe he also turned into a Dark monster.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:56.950
The Seal will seal away the loser's soul?  What did he mean?

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:00.240
Your servant is doing well, Rafael.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.390
He has the upper hand against Yugi.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:08.830
If the Nameless Pharaoh loses, it means he never stood a chance against us.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.240
That leaves Katsuya Jonouchi.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:13.270
And Seto Kaiba.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:20.710
If we take their three souls, our plan is pretty much accomplished.

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:23.120
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:28.120
I summon Alpha The Magnet Warrior in attack position!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.080
My trap card now activates!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.520
Hidden Soldiers!

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:39.190
This card activates when you summon a monster.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:43.600
I can summon a Dark Attribute monster from my hand.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:45.860
Come out, Makyura the Destructor!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:56.210
I also activate a spell card from my hand!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.800
I activate The Shallow Grave!

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:05.380
We both summon a monster from our graveyard in defense position.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.320
The monster I resurrect is...

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.760
Beta The Magnet Warrior!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:16.330
Alpha, Beta and Gamma!  I have three Magnet Warriors on my field!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.920
Combine using electromagnetic power!

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:33.050
Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:39.560
You don't have a monster in your graveyard to summon.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.720
Not bad, Yugi Muto.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:44.720
No wonder people talk about him.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:47.960
But Gurimo still has that card.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:52.060
Go!  Valkyrion the Magna Warrior!

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:53.810
Magnet Sword!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.940
I end my turn.

00:19:58.180 --> 00:19:59.450
All right!

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:00.540
You did it!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.610
Yugi has higher life points now!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:07.320
That's why you're the King of Duelists.

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:11.780
You summoned a powerful monster quickly.

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:17.130
There aren't many monsters that can withstand Valkyrion's attack points.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.720
But I do!

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:21.320
Stop bluffing!

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:27.620
Only a God Card will have more than 3500 attack points-

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.930
It can't be!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:36.370
Yes.  I'm bringing out a God Card, Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:43.310
I use Monster Reborn to resurrect Marauding Captain!

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:50.590
Wait!  If you can't control the God, you'll be...

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:54.370
I tribute my three monsters.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.530
Don't do it!

00:20:56.530 --> 00:21:02.000
Show yourself!  Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.110
Obelisk!

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.980
What?  No way!

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:22.160
It gained attack points?

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:24.920
Even Obelisk became a Dark monster?

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:33.310
You said that only the chosen ones can control a God.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:38.870
But I can using The Seal of Orichalcos's power!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.420
The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:45.600
Duelists who can control the Gods without Millennium Items.

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:48.720
Who are they?

00:21:57.070 --> 00:22:05.980
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:14.320
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:25.480
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.100 --> 00:22:35.000
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:44.030
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:49.540
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:54.720
For me to be me

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.180
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:08.820
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:18.480
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:29.850
To get back his stolen God Cards, Yugi accepts Doma's challenge.

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:33.880
But can Yugi do anything against a God Card?

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:39.420
The Seal of Orichalcos keeps powering up his opponent's monsters.

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:42.890
If he loses this duel, will he really lose his soul?

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:46.300
But the opponent is acting weird.

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:48.950
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Seal of Orichalcos

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:50.450
Duel, standby!
